=== Properties Mist Sample ===
--- Auto-Properties ---
AutoProps(Name=Alice, Id=A001, Count=0, Label=default)
AutoProps(Name=Bob, Id=A001, Count=5, Label=updated)
--- Block Accessors ---
BlockAccessors(Temperature=20)
  After set 100: 20
  After set -999 (clamped): -273
--- Expression-Bodied ---
ExpressionBodied(Width=5, Height=3, Area=15)
  After Height=10: Area=50
--- Field Keyword ---
FieldKeyword(Name=Charlie, Age=0)
FieldKeyword(Name=Dana, Age=25)
  After invalid age: 25
--- Mixed Accessors ---
MixedAccessors(Score=0, Status=active)
  After invalid score: 0
--- Accessor Modifiers ---
AccessorModifiers(Name=Eve, Value=10)
AccessorModifiers(Name=Frank, Value=11)
--- Init Accessors ---
InitAccessors(Name=Grace, Year=0)
--- Static Properties ---
  HasInstances before: False
StaticProps(name=One, total=2)
  HasInstances after: True
  InstanceCount: 2
--- Computed Properties ---
ComputedProps(Area=24, Perimeter=20, IsSquare=False)
ComputedProps(Area=25, Perimeter=20, IsSquare=True)
--- Interface Properties ---
LabeledItem(Label=Widget, Value=99)
  After edit: Label=Widget, Value=200
--- Indexers ---
  idx[0]=10 idx[1]=20 idx[2]=30
IndexerDemo(length=3)
